    "notes": [
      {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 2700,
        "text": "R7b wood-heart  PURPOSE: the climb up the inside of the oak (claws), the glow-cap snuffed, Tatter's root, the crown"
      },
      {
        "x": 1180,
        "y": 2760,
        "text": "DOWN: the hub's up-shaft carries on (both faces hold)"
      },
      {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 2300,
        "text": "REST LEDGE: W-rest's cut spot; dang-knot drops on it from the knot-hole (step back, cut it hanging)"
      },
      {
        "x": 420,
        "y": 2520,
        "text": "THE DARK WAY: the hole at the ledge's back, the tunnel, the chimney (no lamps, slower) up to the band's top"
      },
      {
        "x": 1560,
        "y": 1700,
        "text": "the near face holds up to W-ff; above it a thorn band"
      },
      {
        "x": 1180,
        "y": 1660,
        "text": "W-ff, the firefly's glow-cap (lit after the glimpse): be caught, beat free up-left, thrown to the band"
      },
      {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 1600,
        "text": "the far face's band (holds); slick under it"
      },
      {
        "x": 880,
        "y": 1290,
        "text": "the knot bridge (one-way): from its tip, down-cut W-ff (pogo snuff); jump to the near face over the thorns"
      },
      {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 1180,
        "text": "FIND: bark knot, W-knot behind it"
      },
      {
        "x": 1300,
        "y": 980,
        "text": "the open crown: W-crown, hawk-crown dives across the shaft at her on the face / in the orbit"
      },
      {
        "x": 1550,
        "y": 360,
        "text": "the root's knot (one cut): the root falls down the trunk; Tatter climbs"
      },
      {
        "x": 1880,
        "y": 330,
        "text": "P5, THE CROWN (trigger crown, hold): the look-out, the cloud of every moth she freed lifts off"
      },
      {
        "x": 2300,
        "y": 300,
        "text": "E: the canopy road east (area 2)"
      },
      {
        "x": 620,
        "y": 220,
        "text": "postgame: the lantern over the crown gap (the Fling promise)"
      }
    ],
